(* 
   ====================================================================================================
   Title       : Pyrolysis Depolymerization Reactor Controller
   Description : Advanced IEC 61131-3 implementation for plastics recycling.
                 Manages inert nitrogen blanketing, microwave-assisted heating matrices, 
                 and fractional distillation sequencing for syncrude recovery.
